# The upload of a review build of the Storytime app (plan task 6.2, round 8).
#
# It keeps only what the storytime image needs: apps/storytime, the six packages of the Dockerfile
# COPY set, the root manifests, and the lock and workspace files. Gitignore has a strict rule: no
# rule re-includes a file below an ignored folder. So this file uses /apps/* and /packages/* with
# one re-include per folder it keeps, and never a bare *.
# The 2026-11-21 trim (A-71 preview): the commit holds 92781 tracked files, and the upload of the
# whole packages folder was 413.6 MiB. The image reads no package outside the Dockerfile COPY set,
# so the other packages and their assets stay out of the upload.
# The CD build does not use this file; it uses the root .gcloudignore.
/*
!/apps
/apps/*
!/apps/storytime
!/packages
/packages/*
!/packages/auth
!/packages/backend
!/packages/config
!/packages/db
!/packages/read-along
!/packages/storage
!/package.json
!/pnpm-lock.yaml
!/pnpm-workspace.yaml
!/turbo.json
!/.pnpmfile.cjs
!/.dockerignore
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/credentials*.json
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/service-account*.json
**/*-key.json
**/.npmrc
**/.netrc
**/.docker/
**/id_rsa*
**/id_ed25519*
**/id_ecdsa*
**/*.ppk
